.TH ferry-backup-restore 1  Ferry "Ferry Manual"
.SH NAME
ferry\-backup\-restore \- Restore a backup made here, in the desktop app or on Android: its key replaces this device\*(Aqs key (kept as a `.bak` file) and its paired devices are added
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBferry backup restore\fR [\fB\-\-lang\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIFILE\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Restore a backup made here, in the desktop app or on Android: its key replaces this device\*(Aqs key (kept as a `.bak` file) and its paired devices are added
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-lang\fR \fI<CODE>\fR
Interface language for this run (`en`, `pl`); overrides the saved setting
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIFILE\fR>
Backup file (`.ferry\-backup`)
